Error [E0003]: expected `::` or `:=` in a binding, found `:`
  --> tests/ui/uninit_annotated_retired.jet:6:6
    |
  6 |     x: Int := uninit
    |      ^
 Why: a binding is `name :: value` (immutable) or `name := value` (mutable); types ride the value
 Fix: write `name :: value` or put the type on the value (e.g. `Type.{ … }`)
